TEST 16453 -- loop-protection action: link down
===========================================================================
Run: 2026-09-22 10:23:43  tb470
The loop is REAL and physical: stack port1.0.2 -- x230 -- 4050 -- stack port4.0.2 (po1).
The x230<->4050 leg is normally held shut; this case closes it to create
the loop, then re-opens it. RSTP is disabled on all three devices, so
loop-protection is the only thing standing between this and a storm.

